WEBVTT

00:07.080 --> 00:10.520
Have you ever heard about that

00:10.520 --> 00:13.900
the cliff of a snow mountain

00:13.920 --> 00:19.590
once fascinated numerous people?

00:20.720 --> 00:23.960
Legend has it that,

00:23.960 --> 00:27.310
there were treasures at the peak

00:27.600 --> 00:33.230
but also there was a bottomless chasm hidden over there.

00:34.280 --> 00:37.740
The smart, the fool

00:37.760 --> 00:41.110
and the kind people,

00:41.200 --> 00:47.590
all are familiar to you.

00:47.920 --> 00:51.780
On the mountainside, on the cliff,

00:51.800 --> 00:54.780
on the cloud,

00:54.800 --> 01:00.470
and in the human world,

01:11.760 --> 01:19.590
snowflakes are drifting profusely and disorderly.

01:30.800 --> 01:34.800
Joy of Life Season 1

01:34.800 --> 01:38.270
Episode 46

01:39.260 --> 01:40.850
Master Zhuang has passed away.

01:41.690 --> 01:42.920
What?

01:43.730 --> 01:45.090
He died this morning.

01:45.260 --> 01:47.130
When he was on his deathbed, he asked me to go to his place

01:47.500 --> 01:49.410
and hand these things over to you.

01:51.220 --> 01:52.960
This is a list compiled by him.

01:57.500 --> 01:58.990
He left all the books he collected

01:59.010 --> 02:00.450
to you.

02:09.570 --> 02:11.480
Do you know what it means?

02:12.780 --> 02:14.180
It means he relies on you

02:14.180 --> 02:16.040
as for the inheritance of literature.

02:16.090 --> 02:18.810
He places great expectations on you.

02:27.280 --> 02:29.470
=Poetic Genius=

02:30.340 --> 02:32.970
Man like you who's capable of writing wonderful poems

02:33.730 --> 02:36.530
shouldn't be defiled by the secular world.

02:37.370 --> 02:38.450
I can't bear to see

02:38.450 --> 02:41.810
these excellent poems covered by dust.

02:55.260 --> 02:57.240
Actually, I just saw him twice.

02:57.260 --> 02:59.760
As for the inheritance of literature, it's all about the spirit.

03:00.340 --> 03:02.070
His last words are

03:02.090 --> 03:03.890
that you should follow your heart.

03:04.620 --> 03:06.400
He also said...

03:06.730 --> 03:09.000
I've been living a happy life.

03:10.010 --> 03:11.880
I've never felt wronged

03:11.900 --> 03:13.920
or cheated myself.

03:14.340 --> 03:15.890
Your Excellency Fan,

03:16.340 --> 03:18.920
I hope it's the same case for you.

03:19.340 --> 03:20.880
Live a happy life.

03:20.900 --> 03:23.400
Be happy.

03:27.540 --> 03:29.090
Happy.

03:29.370 --> 03:31.120
Happy.

03:31.420 --> 03:32.810
Happy.

03:39.260 --> 03:40.800
In my lifetime,

03:40.820 --> 03:42.760
I've annotated numerous books

03:43.140 --> 03:45.330
and written many articles.

03:46.180 --> 03:47.880
But my experience is

03:47.900 --> 03:49.810
what I feel most proud of.

04:16.540 --> 04:17.970
I must go too.

04:21.170 --> 04:22.190
I think

04:22.210 --> 04:23.970
we'll see each other again.

04:28.170 --> 04:29.600
Lili is also here.

04:30.050 --> 04:31.370
Where?

04:31.980 --> 04:33.370
Stop looking.

04:33.860 --> 04:35.760
She's staying where she can see you.

04:44.610 --> 04:46.690
Biejie.

04:47.540 --> 04:48.850
"Please don't"?
('Biejie' sounds like 'Please don't' in Chinese)

04:49.700 --> 04:51.530
What a weird name.

04:51.650 --> 04:54.010
Go! Hurry!

04:57.140 --> 04:58.800
Mr. Yan!

04:58.820 --> 05:00.150
Leave here now.

05:00.170 --> 05:01.370
My brother wants to kill all of you.

05:01.370 --> 05:02.930
Leave here before it's too late.

05:02.930 --> 05:04.410
Go!

05:19.020 --> 05:20.290
Brother!

05:28.020 --> 05:31.970
For the sake of our country, kill all the Nanqing people.

05:32.330 --> 05:34.010
Is Shen Zhong crazy?

05:36.210 --> 05:37.720
The Imperial Guards are also here.

05:37.740 --> 05:39.250
They're here to protect Lili.

06:47.170 --> 06:49.810
I know about your wounds most.

06:49.890 --> 06:51.130
Brother!

07:51.260 --> 07:52.030
Go.

07:52.050 --> 07:53.370
Hurry up.

07:53.740 --> 07:54.880
Go!

07:56.050 --> 07:57.200
Don't be afraid.

07:58.020 --> 07:59.570
You won't die.

08:02.580 --> 08:03.970
I'll save you.

08:04.700 --> 08:06.160
You won't die.

09:59.170 --> 10:02.520
Heaven wants to destroy Beiqi!

10:22.580 --> 10:24.040
Fan Xian.

10:24.700 --> 10:26.040
Don't move!

10:35.340 --> 10:37.890
A large number of goods in Neiku have been smuggled.

10:38.730 --> 10:40.510
Actually, I've paid attention to that.

10:40.530 --> 10:42.080
But the money

10:42.780 --> 10:43.580
has been transferred

10:43.580 --> 10:45.680
to the biggest family of Nanqing,

10:45.700 --> 10:47.400
the Ming family.

10:48.410 --> 10:49.680
The Ming family?

10:49.700 --> 10:51.210
This family

10:51.490 --> 10:54.250
works for the Second Prince and Li Yunrui.

10:57.850 --> 10:59.030
No.

10:59.050 --> 11:01.270
Li Yunrui has been supporting the Crown Prince.

11:01.290 --> 11:03.010
You're fooled.

11:04.260 --> 11:05.840
Oh. Fan Xian,

11:06.970 --> 11:08.840
I've left you a present.

11:29.170 --> 11:31.080
Why did you tell me about it suddenly?

11:32.170 --> 11:33.690
I want to exchange it

11:35.220 --> 11:36.960
for my sister's life.

11:44.730 --> 11:46.080
To be honest,

11:47.460 --> 11:48.140
I really want to

11:48.140 --> 11:50.040
kill you and Yan Bingyun.

11:53.050 --> 11:53.700
I know.

11:53.700 --> 11:55.570
The odds are against us.

11:58.660 --> 12:00.400
When the Imperial Guards showed up,

12:01.340 --> 12:02.760
I made a choice.

12:02.780 --> 12:04.890
I didn't stop

12:05.530 --> 12:07.010
when my sister stood in the way,

12:08.290 --> 12:10.280
but she's not fatally injured.

12:13.220 --> 12:14.840
Only by doing that

12:17.530 --> 12:19.130
can I give her a chance to survive.

12:37.050 --> 12:39.130
I'll die, anyway,

12:42.700 --> 12:43.970
but I'm afraid

12:43.970 --> 12:45.570
life will be harder for her

12:46.730 --> 12:48.250
if she stays in Beiqi alone.

12:52.170 --> 12:53.520
Your Excellency Fan,

12:58.370 --> 13:01.920
please take my sister to Nanqing.

13:13.530 --> 13:14.920
I promise.

13:44.900 --> 13:45.730
Your Excellency Shen,

13:45.730 --> 13:47.570
you can leave with us.

13:57.460 --> 13:59.600
None of the Embroidered Uniform Guards of Beiqi

14:01.140 --> 14:03.480
has ever chosen to give in to the enemy.

14:11.140 --> 14:12.320
Take him back

14:12.340 --> 14:14.040
and wait for His Majesty's orders.

14:14.900 --> 14:16.480
-Go. -Go.

14:20.610 --> 14:21.810
Go.

14:22.370 --> 14:24.120
Go.

14:24.140 --> 14:26.890
-Go. -Go. Go.

14:41.730 --> 14:43.520
If it hadn't been for Lili,

14:43.700 --> 14:45.280
the majority of you

14:45.340 --> 14:47.370
would've been killed here.

14:47.850 --> 14:49.520
Remember what she did for you.

14:50.930 --> 14:52.480
I'll pretend not to see her.

14:52.530 --> 14:54.010
Hide her in the cart and take her back.

15:01.900 --> 15:03.720
Now we really have to say goodbye.

15:04.530 --> 15:06.200
But I always think

15:06.220 --> 15:07.770
we'll see each other again.

16:16.100 --> 16:17.150
There you are.

16:17.170 --> 16:18.490
A lot of people are anxious about

16:18.490 --> 16:20.570
the possibility of your staging a comeback.

16:21.490 --> 16:23.450
It just proves they're afraid of you.

16:25.020 --> 16:26.600
It's not easy

16:27.220 --> 16:29.880
to rise from the ashes.

16:29.900 --> 16:31.370
So,

16:31.730 --> 16:33.480
if I kill you at this moment,

16:33.820 --> 16:36.570
nobody would feel pity for you.

16:36.820 --> 16:37.830
The Empress Dowager would just scold you

16:37.850 --> 16:40.210
when she knows about it.

16:40.290 --> 16:42.160
She may not punish you at all.

16:43.730 --> 16:45.520
Did you force my subordinates

16:46.020 --> 16:48.330
to kill themselves?

16:48.370 --> 16:49.760
Yes.

16:49.780 --> 16:52.030
Was my adoptive father killed by you?

16:52.050 --> 16:53.600
Exactly.

16:54.580 --> 16:56.370
That is

16:57.050 --> 16:59.270
why I'll kill you!

16:59.290 --> 17:00.840
I know.

17:02.170 --> 17:03.240
Grand General,

17:03.260 --> 17:05.130
His Majesty hasn't issued an imperial edict.

17:24.130 --> 17:26.080
It's snowing.

17:30.620 --> 17:35.130
Go to hell!

18:22.410 --> 18:24.170
This is

18:25.010 --> 18:26.930
my revenge.

18:51.170 --> 18:53.150
Lady Shen's wound is nothing serious,

18:53.170 --> 18:54.600
but she hasn't come round.

18:54.620 --> 18:57.170
You don't need to tell me anything about her.

18:59.700 --> 19:02.080
But I saw you hold her in your arms.

19:02.530 --> 19:03.990
She's a Beiqi person.

19:04.010 --> 19:05.440
Not anymore.

19:05.740 --> 19:07.440
Someone said

19:07.890 --> 19:09.870
people who have feelings

19:09.890 --> 19:11.650
and know about his love

19:11.980 --> 19:13.050
are stronger

19:13.050 --> 19:14.410
than those who are cold and ruthless.

19:18.500 --> 19:20.200
Don't you have anything to say?

19:22.100 --> 19:23.480
Now that you know

19:23.500 --> 19:25.800
it was the Second Prince that tried to kill you,

19:25.820 --> 19:27.290
what will you do?

19:29.100 --> 19:30.480
I'll ask him why he did that

19:30.500 --> 19:31.630
when I go back.

19:31.650 --> 19:32.560
Once you ask him this question,

19:32.580 --> 19:33.750
there'll be no turning back.

19:33.770 --> 19:35.080
He wants to kill me.

19:35.100 --> 19:36.600
How can I pretend not to know about it?

19:36.620 --> 19:37.960
Your opponent is a prince.

19:37.980 --> 19:39.030
Do you think the odds are in your favor?

19:39.050 --> 19:40.560
I don't care about the odds.

19:40.580 --> 19:41.840
What do you care about?

19:41.860 --> 19:44.320
I have to fight back now that he wants to kill me.

19:44.860 --> 19:46.890
Only in this way can I live a happy life.

19:52.580 --> 19:54.130
Will you help me

19:54.170 --> 19:55.650
when we go back to the capital city?

19:57.890 --> 19:58.620
You can think about it

19:58.620 --> 20:00.080
on the way.

20:02.010 --> 20:03.560
No matter if you decide

20:03.860 --> 20:05.680
to help me

20:05.740 --> 20:06.840
or to support the Second Prince,

20:06.860 --> 20:08.390
you have to make a choice

20:08.410 --> 20:10.010
since you've known the truth.

20:14.770 --> 20:16.200
I'll wait for your reply.

20:56.130 --> 20:58.250
I've never been into you.

20:59.740 --> 21:01.130
I know.

21:01.650 --> 21:03.250
I tried to hate you,

21:03.620 --> 21:07.250
but I still don't have the heart
to see you be tortured like this.

21:09.220 --> 21:12.680
I've never loved you.

21:37.740 --> 21:38.600
Go.

21:38.620 --> 21:40.080
Hurry up.

21:40.100 --> 21:41.440
Go!

22:31.100 --> 22:32.320
What's up?

22:32.580 --> 22:33.890
Someone is around.

22:39.650 --> 22:40.410
Where?

22:40.410 --> 22:41.680
Your Excellency,

22:42.460 --> 22:44.200
I'm bad at everything else

22:44.340 --> 22:45.860
except the art of

22:45.860 --> 22:46.960
tracking.

22:46.980 --> 22:48.890
Your Excellency, you know that.

22:48.980 --> 22:49.870
I'm sure

22:49.890 --> 22:52.050
someone is watching us out there.

22:56.700 --> 22:58.250
Come on. Have a cake.

23:05.050 --> 23:07.250
Your Excellency, the cakes are for you.

23:14.580 --> 23:16.130
What are you looking at?

23:22.930 --> 23:24.080
Who is it?

23:47.380 --> 23:48.960
Xie Bi'an?

23:59.500 --> 24:00.840
Mr. Yan.

24:01.130 --> 24:02.110
What's up?

24:02.130 --> 24:04.170
His Excellency Fan wants to see you.

24:22.050 --> 24:23.600
Xie Bi'an is here.

24:24.740 --> 24:26.800
The swordsman that works for the Second Prince?

24:27.050 --> 24:28.320
Exactly.

24:28.580 --> 24:29.800
Where is he?

24:29.980 --> 24:31.930
I let him go have a rest.

24:33.100 --> 24:34.770
Is he here to deliver a letter?

24:35.220 --> 24:36.440
Yeah.

24:39.380 --> 24:42.320
He wanted us to open it at the same time.

24:46.620 --> 24:47.840
It's for you.

25:00.860 --> 25:04.250
Let's treat the letter like face-to-face conversation.

25:06.010 --> 25:09.770
I miss you since you left the capital city.

25:11.010 --> 25:12.930
I know myself well enough.

25:13.460 --> 25:14.840
You know,

25:15.010 --> 25:16.930
I'm a little lazy.

25:17.380 --> 25:18.410
I hate to beat around the bush.

25:18.410 --> 25:20.680
So, let's get straight to the point.

25:21.530 --> 25:22.930
Fan Xian,

25:23.380 --> 25:24.340
you must've known

25:24.340 --> 25:26.770
what I did in Shangjing.

25:27.770 --> 25:29.200
Let me put it this way.

25:29.820 --> 25:31.480
In this world,

25:31.500 --> 25:34.410
it's the most difficult thing to be an emperor's son.

25:35.220 --> 25:37.370
Conflicts also take place among men in other families,

25:37.620 --> 25:41.250
but as a loser, they'll just lose bright futures,

25:41.980 --> 25:43.410
lose family property

25:46.130 --> 25:47.930
or lose face.

25:48.890 --> 25:50.480
If I lose,

25:51.890 --> 25:53.600
I'll die.

25:54.620 --> 25:56.870
So, I've done all those things

25:56.890 --> 25:58.560
to survive.

25:58.650 --> 26:01.530
I hope you can understand.

26:03.100 --> 26:04.600
You must've guessed

26:04.820 --> 26:06.650
the one you fought

26:06.770 --> 26:09.320
is on my side.

26:11.740 --> 26:13.250
I have to admit

26:13.380 --> 26:15.130
what happened to you

26:15.890 --> 26:17.530
was caused by me.

26:19.170 --> 26:21.050
I don't have much choice.

26:21.050 --> 26:22.100
Please forgive me.

26:22.100 --> 26:24.680
However, to be honest,

26:25.130 --> 26:26.930
I think really highly of you.

26:27.930 --> 26:31.680
A man shouldn't live in the past.

26:32.220 --> 26:34.270
If you forgive and forget,

26:34.290 --> 26:35.580
I swear

26:35.580 --> 26:37.050
I'll make you

26:37.050 --> 26:39.770
the most powerful minister in Nanqing.

26:41.770 --> 26:44.200
Since then, the Fan family

26:44.290 --> 26:47.600
will be the No.1 family in Nanqing.

26:48.530 --> 26:49.530
I've heard you dream of

26:49.530 --> 26:50.930
living a life without worry.

26:52.860 --> 26:54.410
I can help you do that.

26:55.930 --> 26:59.230
You have my word.

26:59.250 --> 27:00.170
I asked Xie Bi'an

27:00.170 --> 27:01.840
to take you a gift.

27:01.890 --> 27:03.050
I hope you can feel

27:03.050 --> 27:04.840
my great sincerity

27:05.340 --> 27:07.770
and agree to give me a helping hand.

27:15.100 --> 27:16.680
What did he write in the letter?

27:20.250 --> 27:21.560
Tell me about yours first.

27:22.290 --> 27:24.680
He promised to give me a high position with a high salary.

27:25.170 --> 27:27.960
In a word, he hopes I can forgive and forget.

27:30.930 --> 27:32.680
He said everything that should be said,

27:33.170 --> 27:35.130
but no details have been given.

27:35.290 --> 27:37.170
There is even no signature.

27:37.580 --> 27:39.320
It can't be used as evidence.

27:39.820 --> 27:41.320
He's cunning.

27:44.650 --> 27:46.250
A life without worry?

27:47.290 --> 27:48.600
Yep.

27:50.580 --> 27:51.980
You know,

27:51.980 --> 27:53.890
I'm not ambitious.

27:54.130 --> 27:56.840
I just want to live a rich, cozy life.

27:57.530 --> 28:00.650
I have no desire to go further ahead.
All I want is to live quietly.

28:03.980 --> 28:05.650
Then you should say yes.

28:06.650 --> 28:08.440
I'd like to,

28:10.620 --> 28:11.700
but those who died

28:11.700 --> 28:13.370
hold me by the corner of my clothing.

28:14.170 --> 28:15.840
I want to keep them quiet.

28:16.380 --> 28:18.050
I want to let them loosen their grip.

28:21.130 --> 28:22.840
You don't want to reach a compromise?

28:23.930 --> 28:25.800
Everyone has to be responsible

28:26.170 --> 28:28.170
for the consequences of his choices in life.

28:29.100 --> 28:31.770
He'll be rewarded if he does things right.

28:31.860 --> 28:33.480
He'll be punished

28:33.500 --> 28:35.170
if he does things wrong.

28:35.860 --> 28:37.050
If a thing happens

28:37.050 --> 28:38.770
and the consequences are ignored,

28:40.460 --> 28:42.370
I'll be resentful.

28:47.410 --> 28:49.170
If I'm resentful,

28:50.290 --> 28:52.320
how could I live a happy life?

29:04.100 --> 29:05.370
How about you?

29:05.580 --> 29:07.200
What did he write in the letter to you?

29:08.700 --> 29:10.800
He asked me to understand something.

29:11.050 --> 29:12.870
If the truth is exposed,

29:12.890 --> 29:14.930
he'll do all he can to revolt.

29:15.340 --> 29:16.600
By then,

29:16.620 --> 29:18.360
disturbances are bound to happen in Nanqing.

29:18.380 --> 29:19.650
So what?

29:22.700 --> 29:24.800
Everything the Investigator's Office has done

29:24.820 --> 29:26.150
aims to prevent Nanqing

29:26.170 --> 29:27.390
from falling into turmoil.

29:27.410 --> 29:29.680
That's also my duty as long as I live.

29:30.740 --> 29:32.440
Will you tolerate corruption

29:32.620 --> 29:34.680
to prevent turmoil?

29:36.340 --> 29:37.840
I need more time to think about it.

29:45.460 --> 29:48.010
He said he's got me a gift.

29:48.740 --> 29:50.290
How about looking at it with me?

30:02.380 --> 30:03.720
Your Excellency.

30:05.700 --> 30:06.800
Where is Wang?

30:06.980 --> 30:08.720
He's arranging with the mission.

30:08.740 --> 30:10.230
He said it's safer not to let too many people

30:10.250 --> 30:11.960
know about what's happening here.

30:12.340 --> 30:14.870
Wang Qinian is considerate.

30:14.890 --> 30:16.170
Yeah.

30:17.980 --> 30:19.720
Mr. Yan, you had a narrow escape from death.

30:19.820 --> 30:21.250
Congratulations.

30:22.290 --> 30:23.720
I have a question for you.

30:24.130 --> 30:25.600
Please go ahead.

30:25.770 --> 30:27.650
When did the Second Prince know about

30:27.650 --> 30:30.370
what the mission had done in Shangjing?

30:32.010 --> 30:34.200
The two places are thousands of miles apart
and it's inconvenient to communicate,

30:34.250 --> 30:35.170
so His Highness didn't know

30:35.170 --> 30:37.030
what the mission had done in Shangjing.

30:37.050 --> 30:38.560
So why did he ask you

30:38.580 --> 30:40.410
to send us such a letter?

30:42.980 --> 30:47.010
Because His Highness believes in His Excellency Fan.

30:47.340 --> 30:49.030
On the day when you left the capital city,

30:49.050 --> 30:50.560
His Highness said that

30:51.130 --> 30:52.440
you'd find out the truth

30:52.460 --> 30:54.680
about what happened in Shangjing.

30:54.700 --> 30:56.840
When you go back,

30:56.930 --> 30:58.960
tell him that I believe his sincerity.

31:00.250 --> 31:02.170
But I'm narrow-minded.

31:02.500 --> 31:03.800
I won't forgive him.

31:04.890 --> 31:06.440
His Highness asked you

31:08.290 --> 31:10.600
to accept his gift.

31:15.820 --> 31:17.290
He said

31:17.650 --> 31:19.800
you lost a guard

31:20.050 --> 31:22.050
and he should do something to make it up.

31:32.050 --> 31:32.860
That kid will

31:32.860 --> 31:34.370
learn from the best teacher

31:34.410 --> 31:36.200
and have the brightest future.

31:37.460 --> 31:38.770
His Highness asked you

31:38.770 --> 31:40.290
to trust him.

31:55.250 --> 31:56.680
Moreover,

31:57.500 --> 31:59.410
there is more than one layer in the box.

32:08.250 --> 32:09.800
Please look at the stamp.

32:12.890 --> 32:14.930
Danbo Bookstore.

32:20.530 --> 32:22.720
Your brother is my good buddy.

32:22.740 --> 32:24.960
Of course I'll give you more chances.

32:24.980 --> 32:26.960
Do you mean

32:26.980 --> 32:28.860
there is something else I can do

32:28.860 --> 32:31.290
to make more money besides running a bookstore?

32:32.650 --> 32:36.930
It'll let you make a fortune.

32:42.530 --> 32:44.630
His Highness said

32:44.650 --> 32:46.110
Fan Sizhe is pure and cute

32:46.130 --> 32:47.960
and he's a likeable guy.

32:54.460 --> 32:55.770
Fan Sizhe is a legitimate child

32:55.770 --> 32:57.530
and I'm a bastard son.

32:57.620 --> 32:59.720
Do you think I'm getting well along with him?

33:01.010 --> 33:02.440
His Highness said

33:02.770 --> 33:04.650
you look cynical and

33:04.650 --> 33:07.200
act weird at ordinary times,

33:07.410 --> 33:08.980
but by nature,

33:08.980 --> 33:11.030
you care about your family and friends.

33:11.050 --> 33:11.870
He said

33:11.890 --> 33:13.530
he couldn't get it wrong.

33:14.010 --> 33:16.170
He's quite confident.

33:18.860 --> 33:20.720
The box has three layers in total.

33:36.460 --> 33:38.680
I've been observing your hands.

33:38.700 --> 33:40.960
I've measured your hand size in secret.

33:41.650 --> 33:44.080
Okay. I like it.

33:56.930 --> 33:57.740
How could you

33:57.740 --> 33:59.530
catch Fei Jie?

34:01.650 --> 34:03.290
Mr. Fei is an expert on poisons and poisoning.

34:03.650 --> 34:05.440
Of course we couldn't catch him.

34:05.890 --> 34:07.320
But everyone

34:07.460 --> 34:08.840
has a soft spot.

34:09.860 --> 34:11.210
Really?

34:14.380 --> 34:15.290
I don't know

34:15.290 --> 34:17.240
what his soft spot is.

34:19.580 --> 34:21.280
Your Excellency Fan,

34:21.730 --> 34:24.840
you're Mr. Fei's soft spot.

34:31.770 --> 34:33.000
Mr. Fei.

34:34.210 --> 34:35.470
Is it taken there?

34:35.490 --> 34:36.650
Yeah.

34:36.940 --> 34:37.920
I asked Xie Bi'an

34:37.940 --> 34:38.660
to rush there

34:38.660 --> 34:39.970
with your gloves.

34:40.180 --> 34:43.000
I hope Fan Xian will believe my sincerity

34:44.340 --> 34:46.040
when he sees the gloves.

34:47.490 --> 34:49.370
If he's in trouble,

34:49.450 --> 34:51.470
shouldn't I go there personally?

34:51.490 --> 34:52.840
Mr. Fei.

34:53.290 --> 34:55.800
As Director of the Third Division of the Investigator's Office,

34:55.820 --> 34:57.560
you're always under the watchful eyes of many people.

34:57.730 --> 34:59.190
If you leave the capital city just like that,

34:59.210 --> 35:02.370
it'll be hard to explain it to His Majesty.

35:04.140 --> 35:05.490
But don't worry.

35:05.900 --> 35:07.180
It's just some trivial matters

35:07.180 --> 35:08.160
about the handover of the mission.

35:08.180 --> 35:09.210
I've sent guys there

35:09.210 --> 35:10.930
to give him a helping hand.

35:11.340 --> 35:15.520
I'm sure Fan Xian will be back safe and sound.

35:16.140 --> 35:17.600
Why did you do that?

35:18.420 --> 35:19.800
Because I find a kindred spirit in him.

35:22.660 --> 35:23.530
As soon as you get anything about him,

35:23.530 --> 35:24.920
just let me know.

35:24.940 --> 35:26.490
You can count on me, Mr. Fei.

35:26.660 --> 35:30.370
I'll come to you again.

36:02.010 --> 36:03.490
Is this a threat?

36:05.820 --> 36:08.210
His Highness treats Fan Xian as a good friend.

36:09.050 --> 36:09.660
Of course he wants to

36:09.660 --> 36:11.320
take care of people around him.

36:13.860 --> 36:16.210
What if I don't agree to support him?

36:18.140 --> 36:19.880
His Highness has been making preparations.

36:19.900 --> 36:21.560
He's got lots of money

36:21.860 --> 36:23.560
and some troops.

36:23.580 --> 36:25.240
They'll be here tomorrow

36:25.820 --> 36:28.410
to protect you on your way back.

36:28.970 --> 36:29.770
Do you think how many soldiers you need

36:29.770 --> 36:31.490
to kill me?

36:34.180 --> 36:35.250
His Highness also wants to know

36:35.250 --> 36:36.760
how many people need to die

36:37.420 --> 36:39.040
before you regret

36:39.100 --> 36:41.760
having made a wrong decision.

36:45.010 --> 36:46.490
I'll come here again tomorrow.

36:47.290 --> 36:49.170
I hope you can

36:49.380 --> 36:50.620
give His Highness

36:50.620 --> 36:52.210
a clear-cut answer by then.

36:52.820 --> 36:54.210
If you say yes,

36:54.530 --> 36:56.970
I'll protect you and make sure you go back safe and sound.

36:57.210 --> 36:58.760
If not,

36:58.900 --> 37:00.450
I'll kill you.

37:05.420 --> 37:06.800
Your Excellency.

37:33.730 --> 37:35.520
Sometimes, if you take a step back,

37:35.940 --> 37:38.240
you'll save all their lives

37:38.340 --> 37:40.040
and have a bright future.

37:41.450 --> 37:43.000
Do you still think

37:43.210 --> 37:44.800
you have a choice?

37:44.820 --> 37:46.240
I want to have a try.

37:49.730 --> 37:50.890
How about you?

37:51.660 --> 37:53.970
Have you made your choice?

39:22.050 --> 39:23.320
What time is it?

39:24.140 --> 39:25.520
No idea.

39:26.050 --> 39:27.490
It's not early, anyway.

39:31.290 --> 39:32.730
Gao Da!

39:33.250 --> 39:34.840
Form up and get ready to hit the road.

39:35.580 --> 39:37.080
That's right.

39:37.340 --> 39:39.320
I'm here to see you off.

39:41.660 --> 39:43.370
You've thought about it for a night.

39:43.730 --> 39:45.560
What's your choice?

40:00.690 --> 40:03.370
Fan Sizhe is the legitimate child of the Fan family.

40:04.210 --> 40:06.080
If he dies,

40:06.450 --> 40:09.000
my father won't leave it at that.

40:11.010 --> 40:13.840
Mr. Fei serves as Director of the Third Division
of the Investigator's Office.

40:14.290 --> 40:15.600
If he dies,

40:15.620 --> 40:17.890
the Investigator's Office won't let it go at that.

40:18.970 --> 40:20.520
He doesn't dare

40:21.690 --> 40:23.210
to kill the two of them.

40:25.140 --> 40:25.730
So, what on earth

40:25.730 --> 40:26.840
is your choice?

40:26.860 --> 40:28.560
It's not about my choice,

40:28.580 --> 40:30.520
but yours.

40:31.100 --> 40:32.430
You can

40:32.450 --> 40:35.040
kill all of us here!

40:35.580 --> 40:36.490
Then after you go back,

40:36.490 --> 40:38.180
all of you will be considered betrayers of Nanqing.

40:38.180 --> 40:39.050
Your family will get into trouble

40:39.050 --> 40:40.690
and you'll never rise again.

40:48.900 --> 40:50.240
If you don't,

40:50.940 --> 40:52.530
you'll have to helplessly watch me

40:52.530 --> 40:54.450
go back.

40:55.380 --> 40:57.650
As for the things he asked you to take to me,

40:58.620 --> 41:01.000
I'll give them back to him one by one.

41:03.250 --> 41:04.210
If anything happens to

41:04.210 --> 41:05.050
Teng Zijing's son,

41:05.050 --> 41:07.130
I'll let him pay with his life.

41:08.900 --> 41:10.410
Ask him

41:11.940 --> 41:14.040
if he dares to take such a big risk

41:14.940 --> 41:16.840
because of a kid.

41:20.250 --> 41:22.210
And ask yourself

41:24.210 --> 41:25.970
if you're sure

41:26.180 --> 41:28.650
you can kill me.

41:47.730 --> 41:49.080
Your Excellency!

41:53.010 --> 41:55.450
This is my choice.

42:11.660 --> 42:13.750
Everything the Investigator's Office has done

42:13.770 --> 42:14.690
aims to prevent Nanqing

42:14.690 --> 42:16.320
from falling into turmoil.

42:16.340 --> 42:18.490
That's also my duty as long as I live.

43:01.690 --> 43:03.080
Is he dead?

43:11.580 --> 43:13.280
Is that the end of it?

43:15.100 --> 43:16.450
Of course not.

43:19.920 --> 43:21.080
Take the bull by the horns and die to survive.

43:21.080 --> 43:22.240
It is dedicated to all ordinary but brave people in the world.

43:22.240 --> 43:23.360
It's you who make the world warmer with your love and hope.

43:23.360 --> 43:24.400
The story never ends.
Looking forward to the coming year and seeing you again!

43:24.400 --> 43:26.950
The end of Season 1

43:47.920 --> 43:51.500
In the river of history,

43:51.520 --> 43:54.990
time goes round and round.

43:57.800 --> 44:01.140
Memories about the former and present lives

44:01.160 --> 44:05.230
join each other in an endless way.

44:07.120 --> 44:09.740
In the long drunken Milky Way,

44:09.760 --> 44:12.000
one season follows another in a flash,

44:12.000 --> 44:14.500
and the wild geese are flying south.

44:14.520 --> 44:16.120
I just can't give up

44:16.120 --> 44:19.460
to be with you for my whole life.

44:19.480 --> 44:24.950
I have been hovering in the dreams
for hundreds and thousands of times.

44:26.200 --> 44:28.750
I can't even say a word when I watch the flowers falling.

44:29.040 --> 44:31.080
Year after year in the wandering,

44:31.080 --> 44:33.740
I count the remaining years.

44:33.760 --> 44:35.940
Even though we can't meet each other anymore,

44:35.960 --> 44:37.950
even though we have ended up the destiny,

44:38.240 --> 44:40.630
I never feel regretful.

44:40.680 --> 44:42.040
In such a chaotic world,

44:42.040 --> 44:45.020
I still miss you as ever.

44:45.040 --> 44:47.990
I can't fall asleep under the moon.

44:48.280 --> 44:50.340
With a gentle heart,

44:50.360 --> 44:53.020
I cherish our remaining years.

44:53.040 --> 44:54.560
Even though we have to go through

44:54.560 --> 44:57.070
all the hardships along the journey,

44:57.200 --> 45:04.390
you always stay by my side,

45:04.480 --> 45:07.150
watching the falling flowers, speechlessly.

45:07.440 --> 45:09.520
Year after year in the wandering,

45:09.520 --> 45:12.180
I count the remaining years.

45:12.200 --> 45:14.340
Even though we can't meet each other anymore,

45:14.360 --> 45:16.590
even though we end up the destiny,

45:16.800 --> 45:18.980
I never feel regretful.

45:19.000 --> 45:20.400
In such a chaotic world,

45:20.400 --> 45:23.460
I still miss you as ever.

45:23.480 --> 45:26.590
I can't fall asleep under the moon.

45:26.680 --> 45:28.820
With a gentle heart,

45:28.840 --> 45:31.540
I cherish our remaining years.

45:31.560 --> 45:33.000
Even though we have to go through

45:33.000 --> 45:35.660
all the hardships along the journey,

45:35.680 --> 45:44.440
you always stay by my side...
